---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Complaints"
  description="How to make a complaint to GU NeuroSoc: write to neurosciencesoc@src.gla.ac.uk, and what happens next."
>
  <article class="container-site section">
    <h1 class="headline text-h1 font-black">Complaints</h1>
    <div class="prose-site mt-8">
      <h2>How to complain</h2>
      <p>
        Send your complaint in writing to
        <a href="mailto:neurosciencesoc@src.gla.ac.uk">neurosciencesoc@src.gla.ac.uk</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        If your complaint concerns someone with access to that inbox, contact the Vice-President
        instead: <span class="font-semibold">{'{{VP_EMAIL}}'}</span>.
      </p>
      <h2>What happens next</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>We aim to acknowledge your complaint within 7 working days.</li>
        <li>
          Two committee members review it first: the President or the Vice-President, plus the
          Welfare Officer.
        </li>
        <li>
          We aim to resolve it within 21 working days. If it will take longer, we will tell you.
        </li>
        <li>
          If you ask, a stage-2 review is carried out by two different committee members.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p>Records of complaints are kept by the President until the end of the academic year.</p>
      <p>This process is set out in the society's <a href="/constitution">constitution</a>.</p>
      <h2>SRC procedure</h2>
      <p>
        <a
          href="https://www.glasgowunisrc.org/resources/neurosciencesociety/Complaints-and-Disciplinary-Procedure/"
          >SRC Complaints and Disciplinary Procedure (society copy on the SRC website)</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
